  "_comment": [
    "WHAT IT DROPS DEPENDS ON WHAT BREAKS IT (owner, 2026-09-04). A hand gives the tire; a Scrap",
    "Knife gives rubber straight out of the block. That is the whole tool gate, and it is a loot",
    "condition rather than code - vanilla does exactly this to make dead coral drop only to silk",
    "touch.",
    "",
    "ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING. minecraft:alternatives takes the FIRST child whose conditions pass, so",
    "the knife entry must come first; with the tire first, a knife would yield a tire and the gate",
    "would silently not exist.",
    "",
    "A double slab is two tires, so the count doubles. Vanilla's own slab tables do this with an",
    "explicit block_state_property check rather than by halving anything."
  ],
